    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the zany world of &quot;Rowdy Rascals,&quot; where the ultimate party game experience awaits players of all ages!\u00a0Can you beat the other neighborhood kids in handcrafted minigames before mom gets home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINI GAMES GALORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> Unleash your competitive spirit with a variety of mini-games, each bringing its own twist to the table. Discover quick-to-learn yet challenging-to-master modes that are sure to get the party started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> Give the game an extra spin by using the in-game Modifier Wheel to introduce random modifiers, keeping everyone on their toes. Each round plays differently than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BIG FINALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Watch out: if no winner emerges, brace for an all-out survival boss fight, where last-minute points could redefine the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/78f8b5d8b338bb63ae887d62d32ba00f.avif?t=1737794392\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4-Player Co-Op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whacky Mini Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modifiers Every Round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Abilities to Master</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the zany world of &quot;Rowdy Rascals,&quot; where the ultimate party game experience awaits players of all ages!\u00a0Can you beat the other neighborhood kids in handcrafted minigames before mom gets home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINI GAMES GALORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/53d3c175e163cdf502d64b46142335e1.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> Unleash your competitive spirit with a variety of mini-games, each bringing its own twist to the table. Discover quick-to-learn yet challenging-to-master modes that are sure to get the party started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/7395304f439bfc45633f22ab85cb5a1d.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> Give the game an extra spin by using the in-game Modifier Wheel to introduce random modifiers, keeping everyone on their toes. Each round plays differently than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BIG FINALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.poster.avif?t=1737794392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.webm?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/84124e21db13fb5b13b9b91474c3f5bd.mp4?t=1737794392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Watch out: if no winner emerges, brace for an all-out survival boss fight, where last-minute points could redefine the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552650/extras/78f8b5d8b338bb63ae887d62d32ba00f.avif?t=1737794392\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4-Player Co-Op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whacky Mini Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modifiers Every Round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Abilities to Master</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the rowdiest rascal in the wackiest party game \u2013 for all ages! Play mini-games with unique challenges, spin the Modifier Wheel for surprises, and gear up for a survival boss battle if there's a tie. Get set for non-stop fun and laughter with your friends!",
